    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_qualifying_claims_caveat",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "The claim is broadly valid, with the important caveat that it applies mainly to larger organizations."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "ادعا در کلیت معتبره، با این قید مهم که بیشتر درباره سازمان‌های بزرگ صدق می‌کنه."
        },
        "intent": "add_caveat",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_qualifying_claims_valid",
          "c1_qualifying_claims_caveat"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_qualifying_claims_extent",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "The effect exists, but the extent of it varies considerably by age, location, and income."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اثر وجود داره، ولی میزانش با سن، محل و درآمد خیلی فرق می‌کنه."
        },
        "intent": "qualify_extent",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_qualifying_claims_extent",
          "c1_qualifying_claims_exception"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_qualifying_claims_generalize",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "I would not generalize from this result until we have comparable data from at least two other settings."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "تا وقتی داده قابل مقایسه از حداقل دو محیط دیگه نداشته باشیم، این نتیجه رو تعمیم نمی‌دم."
        },
        "intent": "limit_generalization",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_qualifying_claims_generalize",
          "c1_qualifying_claims_tentative"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_qualifying_claims_conditional",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "My support is conditional on there being a clear review process if the policy produces unintended effects."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "حمایت من مشروط به اینه که اگر سیاست اثر ناخواسته داشت، روند بازبینی روشنی وجود داشته باشه."
        },
        "intent": "state_condition",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_qualifying_claims_conditional",
          "c1_qualifying_claims_caveat"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_qualifying_claims_exception",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The exception matters because it challenges the idea that one mechanism explains every case."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "استثنا مهمه چون این ایده رو به چالش می‌کشه که یک سازوکار همه موارد رو توضیح می‌ده."
        },
        "intent": "use_exception",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_qualifying_claims_exception",
          "c1_qualifying_claims_generalize"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_qualifying_claims_overstate",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Calling the program a complete success would overstate what the current evidence can support."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "موفقیت کامل نامیدن برنامه بیشتر از چیزیه که شواهد فعلی پشتیبانی می‌کنن."
        },
        "intent": "avoid_overstatement",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_qualifying_claims_overstate",
          "c1_qualifying_claims_valid"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_qualifying_claims_tentative",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A more tentative conclusion would be that the approach is promising under certain conditions."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "نتیجه محتاطانه‌تر اینه که رویکرد در بعضی شرایط امیدوارکننده‌ست."
        },
        "intent": "offer_tentative_claim",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_qualifying_claims_tentative",
          "c1_qualifying_claims_conditional"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_qualifying_claims_summary",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "So I accept the direction of the argument, but I would qualify both its scope and its certainty."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "پس جهت استدلال رو می‌پذیرم، ولی هم دامنه و هم میزان قطعیتش رو محدودتر بیان می‌کنم."
        },
        "intent": "summarize_qualification",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_qualifying_claims_extent",
          "c1_qualifying_claims_caveat"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_qualifying_claims_advanced_hedging",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-01",
        "slug": "c1-qualifying-claims-advanced-hedging",
        "title": "Advanced hedging and calibration",
        "rule_summary": "Calibrate certainty with expressions such as arguably, broadly speaking, tends to, appears to, and cannot entirely be ruled out.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در C1 میزان قطعیت را با عبارت‌هایی مثل arguably، broadly speaking، tends to، appears to و cannot entirely be ruled out دقیق تنظیم می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The change appears to have improved access, although the evidence is still limited.",
            "fa": "به نظر می‌رسد این تغییر دسترسی را بهتر کرده، هرچند شواهد هنوز محدود است."
          },
          {
            "en": "That explanation cannot entirely be ruled out.",
            "fa": "نمی‌توان آن توضیح را کاملاً منتفی دانست."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_qualifying_claims_complex_prepositions",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-02",
        "slug": "c1-qualifying-claims-complex-prepositions",
        "title": "Complex prepositional phrases",
        "rule_summary": "Use in light of, with regard to, in the absence of, by virtue of, and at the expense of to express precise logical relations.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای بیان روابط منطقی دقیق از in light of، with regard to، in the absence of، by virtue of و at the expense of استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "In light of the new evidence, the recommendation should be revised.",
            "fa": "با توجه به شواهد جدید، توصیه باید بازبینی شود."
          },
          {
            "en": "Efficiency should not come at the expense of accessibility.",
            "fa": "کارایی نباید به قیمت دسترسی‌پذیری تمام شود."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_c1_qualifying_claims_emphasis_adverbs",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-03",
        "slug": "c1-qualifying-claims-emphasis-adverbs",
        "title": "Fine-grained emphasis",
        "rule_summary": "Use notably, particularly, fundamentally, merely, largely, and precisely to control which part of a claim receives emphasis.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با notably، particularly، fundamentally، merely، largely و precisely مشخص می‌کنیم کدام بخش ادعا باید برجسته شود."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "The problem is largely procedural rather than technical.",
            "fa": "مشکل عمدتاً فرایندی است نه فنی."
          },
          {
            "en": "That is precisely why the distinction matters.",
            "fa": "دقیقاً به همین دلیل این تمایز مهم است."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c1_qualifying_claims_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-qualifying-claims-01",
        "title": "Qualifying Claims: part 1",
        "setting": "podcast planning call",
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "simple-messages",
        "characters": [
          "Ivy",
          "David"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Ivy",
            "text": "Where do you think the strongest part of the case is?",
            "translation_fa": "فکر می‌کنی قوی‌ترین بخش استدلال کجاست؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "David",
            "text": "The claim is broadly valid, with the important caveat that it applies mainly to larger organizations.",
            "translation_fa": "ادعا در کلیت معتبره، با این قید مهم که بیشتر درباره سازمان‌های بزرگ صدق می‌کنه."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Ivy",
            "text": "And where would you qualify it?",
            "translation_fa": "و کجاش رو با احتیاط یا قید بیشتری بیان می‌کردی؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "David",
            "text": "The effect exists, but the extent of it varies considerably by age, location, and income.",
            "translation_fa": "اثر وجود داره، ولی میزانش با سن، محل و درآمد خیلی فرق می‌کنه."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c1_qualifying_claims_scene_2",
      "data": {
